[{:db/id "q-330870/field-1/c051fdc967a073dfb8851db6ab1bc3290f564e5a6ae1b9b8cb99744df1b61e3d" :answer/id #uuid "9dbb1a1f-b567-5677-9ae4-fb86cb3d574b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.3632" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-330870/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "97452a97-7988-5aaa-855c-2766e8746cde" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-330870/field-1/c051fdc967a073dfb8851db6ab1bc3290f564e5a6ae1b9b8cb99744df1b61e3d" :answer-field/choices ["q-330870/field-1/c051fdc967a073dfb8851db6ab1bc3290f564e5a6ae1b9b8cb99744df1b61e3d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-330870" :question/id #uuid "11628d87-4dce-54ef-b67f-387a00fe09a4" :question/math-academy-id "q-330870" :question/problem "The data below is taken from the table of values of the cumulative distribution function $Φ(z)$ for the standard normal distribution. Given that $Z∼N(0,1),$ compute $P(Z<-0.35).$ Use the table below and do not round your answer.\n\n| $z$ | $\\,0.05\\,$ | $\\,0.06\\,$ | $\\,0.07\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\,-0.4\\,$ | $\\,0.3264\\,$ | $\\,0.3228\\,$ | $\\,0.3192\\,$ |\n| $\\,-0.3\\,$ | $\\,0.3632\\,$ | $\\,0.3594\\,$ | $\\,0.3557\\,$ |\n| $\\,-0.2\\,$ | $\\,0.4013\\,$ | $\\,0.3974\\,$ | $\\,0.3936\\,$ |\n\n$P(Z<-0.35)=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "If $Z∼N(0,1),$ then by the definition of the cumulative distribution function $Φ(z),$ \n\n$$\nP(Z\\le z)=Φ(z).\n$$\n\nAlso, since $Z$ is continuous, \n\n$$\nP(Z<-0.35)=P(Z\\le -0.35)=Φ(-0.35).\n$$\n\nThe required probability is represented by the area shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14069404/assets/ab5be5e655c8daad36f35bee1abf3c82e3766b734da928be3dd060db551fbbb9.png)\n\nNow, we determine the value of $Φ(-0.35)$ from the table:\n\n- We first select the row that corresponds to $-0.3$ and the column that corresponds to $0.05.$\n\n- Then, we take the value that lies at the intersection:\n\n| $z$ | $\\,0.05\\,$ | $\\,0.06\\,$ | $\\,0.07\\,$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $\\,-0.4\\,$ | $\\,0.3264\\,$ | $\\,0.3228\\,$ | $\\,0.3192\\,$ |\n| $\\,-0.3\\,$ | $\\,0.3632\\,$ | $\\,0.3594\\,$ | $\\,0.3557\\,$ |\n| $\\,-0.2\\,$ | $\\,0.4013\\,$ | $\\,0.3974\\,$ | $\\,0.3936\\,$ |\n\nTherefore, according to the table, we have\n\n$$\nP(Z\\le -0.35)=Φ(-0.35)=0.3632.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-330870/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "77015ca5-d392-500e-93dc-8e065dd1c06c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-330870"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-131387/selection/85bff4aac0669697d6bef749aeda4402fe1854173d17918d2f833d377f27dc93" :answer/id #uuid "ae998bb4-b165-58c9-aaad-47f1597c514e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.9864" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131387/selection/82a783f1671d8e4f4471863dfbafda342b125627624f2835ee1061f79eaa72d6" :answer/id #uuid "758dbea6-5f1a-59f4-bbbf-3c3f15abfcda" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.9826" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131387/selection/a25550456650a3db95afb8d33b1148c3f17d593c06c146eb88db345f64ee7a69" :answer/id #uuid "137f958b-730c-54ec-8fc6-dc6805337d19" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.9783" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131387/selection/2a82d07aae00a5352866ae979ca27dab4e1b492637e250577c133671a0a8a310" :answer/id #uuid "d19bb30b-20c1-5788-9f95-c71dacc37b78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.9871" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131387/selection/197f4ca7ef00f8b8361ed6005469382685f87b575c17f4c0938d800f82abf1be" :answer/id #uuid "195c9f85-6e1e-5805-acbb-fb5a958c12ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.9778" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-131387/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "989efee3-32c0-57ed-a072-1f0977911d85" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-fiel